+++ b/tenacity/releasenotes/notes/fix-wait-regressions-3f1c9a7e5b2d4c68.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    Falsy ``wait`` values such as ``None``, ``0`` or ``sum([])`` mean "do not
+    wait" again for both ``Retrying`` and ``AsyncRetrying``, instead of raising
+    ``TypeError`` from inside the retry loop.
+  - |
+    Adding a plain callable to a wait strategy (``callable + wait_strategy``)
+    builds a ``wait_combine`` again. A non-zero number on the left is still
+    rejected with ``TypeError``, and ``sum()`` over wait strategies keeps
+    working.
+  - |
+    ``wait_combine`` passes the retry state to each strategy positionally, so
+    callables whose parameter is not named ``retry_state`` work.
